  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "f3b26cc6-8d5e-604e-aa90-d011cefed01c"],
 " subdivisions on its shortest polygon side. Each loop omits the repeated \
closing vertex."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1536416833,ExpressionUUID->"42450022-fa0c-9748-84cd-2aa30a20c097"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The returned list of loops can be used for ",
